# Gaming Citlali Nicole Xianyun. ~20s Rot. Gaming Melt Plunge with 7 plunges, 6 melted. Gaming juggles Man Chai, using burst into skill + plunge & catching Man Chai mid descent alongside grounded waits. The final 2 plunges miss Xianyun's Q buff, & the final plunge is not melted, but is delayed for Gaming's particle ICD. Xianyun's ER just scrapes by.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
gaming char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
gaming add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
gaming add set="cw" count=4;
gaming add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 pyro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
gaming add stats def%=0.062*2 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*2 er=0.0551*3 em=19.82*3 cr=0.0331*12 cd=0.0662*10;

